      "content": "That's a great start for the atmosphere. I really want to get a better sense of the people who actually walk these streets to make the setting feel more lived-in. Can you expand on that? I want to see some of the specific characters or groups hanging out on the corners—the kind of people that make a newcomer feel like they're being watched or that they don't belong there. Use some descriptive details about how they look and act to really hammer home that sense of danger.",
